<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4250"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->PokingAround<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 6:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here&#39;s what I get from: WNSHLWIBYSOTYVBUEOEDONEWPSIODJNCLETOAHLINOETEEIEYO WDSALECNTENOOLLIEAMEO  <BR> <BR>choose new woman <BR>lie <BR>show new id  <BR>tools <BR>bind tie ejaculate <BR>pose body <BR>loot <BR> <BR>&#40;&#39;eye&#39; and &#39;envy&#39; are in there also&#41; <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
