<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4967"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 8:11 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think that BTK looks at this sight and may even pick up pointers. He would be very foolish to post, unless he can do it from an anonymous hub. I am not computer wise. Is it possible to hide completely on the net?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
