<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5584"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 1:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->To the person that posted in the &#34;to BTK&#34; thread as &#34;Jesus Saves&#34;: <BR> <BR>Keeping in mind we have the right given to us by God to judge men&#39;s crimes on Earth we have no right to judge their souls and as unfathomable as it may seem to us... Jesus Christ does care about BTK... If BTK would repent and put his trust in Christ... he can be saved... <BR> <BR> <BR>You left that part out. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
