</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 4:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Have any of us tried to tracert or geotrace the IPs of people posting in that forum? If the BTK is at the age we all believe him to be, how could he learn to operate a proxy?! <BR> <BR>My grandmother can barely work a stove. <BR> <BR>&#40;Just passing through <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> &#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
