<!--Post: 6165--><!--Time: 1107561383-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6165"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 3:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If any of these people posting on the &#34;From BTK thread&#34; were really BTK don&#39;t you think that he would have made it perfectly, painfully clear by now that he is legit? Like maybe telling us what was in any of the packages or communiques, info not released by LE? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
