<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6226"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->W. Hammer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 4:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->440 also adds up to be the number 8. Also some believe there is an eight or vertical infinity sign on some of the marks of the victims and or communications.  Hey, maybe he is talking to us. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
